sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant P as Platform
  participant V as Venue
  participant S as Staff
  C->>P: POST /orders/{id}/cancel
  P->>P: cancellation_status=requested + outbox
  par Serialized on venue order row
    P->>V: cancel
  and
    S->>V: start-preparing
  end
  alt cancel wins
    V->>V: release stock once + cancelled event
  else preparing wins
    V->>V: preparing event + stable rejected cancellation
  end
  V-->>P: stable decision and ordered callback
